<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Crisis Alert — BENZI</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:#F8F9FA;color:#2C3E50;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#b42318;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
        <span style="font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;color:#fff;letter-spacing:2px;">BENZI</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:32px 28px;">
        <h2 style="color:#b42318;margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;">Crisis Alert — Immediate Attention Required</h2>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Your patient <strong>{{patientName}}</strong> has sent a message that may indicate a mental health crisis.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;"><strong>Severity:</strong> {{severity}}</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;"><strong>Message sent at:</strong> {{timestamp}}</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;"><strong>Detected concern:</strong> {{matchedPhrases}}</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;margin:8px 0;"><strong>Source:</strong> {{source}}</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:24px;">Please reach out to your patient as soon as possible or contact emergency services if you believe they are in immediate danger.</p>
        <p style="color:#7d8b7d;font-size:12px;margin-top:28px;">This is an automated alert from BENZI. Do not reply to this email.</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
